WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:02.168
Oh, Andy!

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.545
Oh my.

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:06.297
I can't tell
if that's a good "oh my word" or a bad.

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:07.590
[Nicole] Did you taste it?

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:08.591
Hold on.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:10.844
- [record scratch]
- Yeah, I got it.

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:11.761
[all laugh]

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:13.304
[upbeat music playing]

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:16.808
- It is time to eat some good cake!
- Tell me more.

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:20.603
[Nicole] I found ten people
with dreams of being great bakers.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:21.980
- [gasps]
- Oh shoot!

00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:23.773
[all laugh]

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.818
In the end, the best baker
will get to learn key skills

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:30.196
and take home $100,000!

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.159
I have five daughters.
You know what I could do with 100 grand?

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:39.622
[Jacques] We have enlisted two coaches
to teach you everything you need to learn.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.082
I don't know what to do!

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:43.168
- How's it going with these bakers?
- Ugh!

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:44.836
Some of them are just going haywire.

00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:47.839
Looks like some of you are starting
to use buttercream on your cakes,

00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:49.591
which Robert hasn't even demonstrated yet.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.218
[woman] Oh no, Travis!

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:55.305
I got... Oh!

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.682
- Yeah, yeah. Just get me over with it.
- Angie!

00:00:58.641 --> 00:01:00.477
- I ain't never done no cake like this.
- Go big.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.229
I didn't know
we were sitting among Michelin chefs.

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:04.647
This is a huge improvement.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:08.318
When you make something
from the heart, you feel the love from it.

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:12.405
I don't know if this is right,
but we're gonna double-fist the stirrin'.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:14.699
If we pull this off...

00:01:14.783 --> 00:01:16.576
You have learned so much.

00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:18.328
[Nicole] ...someone might actually...

00:01:18.328 --> 00:01:18.995
Whoa!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.581
- Nailed it!
- [squeals]

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:25.752
We finally had good cake!

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.757
How did you get this job?

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:31.633
I'm really adorable.

